{"title":"Career Roadmap · Lab Technician","role":"Lab Technician","summary":"A Physics Lab Technician supports laboratory teaching, research, testing and experimental activities by preparing equipment, maintaining instruments, assisting with experiments, recording observations and ensuring laboratory safety.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Physics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Physics Lab Technician supports laboratory teaching, research, testing and experimental activities by preparing equipment, maintaining instruments, assisting with experiments, recording observations and ensuring laboratory safety."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc. Physics graduate, this is one of the more accessible technical laboratory careers. The exact scope depends on the employer: universities and colleges may focus on teaching laboratories, while research institutions, testing laboratories and industrial organizations may require more specialized instrumentation skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Preparing laboratory experiments"},{"text":"Setting up physics apparatus"},{"text":"Operating measurement instruments"},{"text":"Calibrating and checking equipment"},{"text":"Recording experimental observations"},{"text":"Maintaining laboratory inventories"},{"text":"Troubleshooting basic equipment issues"},{"text":"Supporting faculty/researchers"},{"text":"Maintaining laboratory documentation"},{"text":"Following electrical and chemical safety procedures"},{"text":"Managing consumables"},{"text":"Supporting equipment procurement"},{"text":"Performing basic data analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Experiment / Test Requirement","Equipment Preparation","Instrument Setup","Calibration / Verification","Experiment","Measurement + Data Recording","Basic Analysis","Result Documentation","Equipment Shutdown + Maintenance"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Physics fundamentals + laboratory safety"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Experimental techniques + instrumentation"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Advanced laboratory work + specialization"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Lab Assistant / Junior Lab Technician"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Lab Technician / Technical Assistant"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Lab Technician / Laboratory Supervisor"}],[{"text":"8+ years"},{"text":"Lab Manager / Technical Laboratory Coordinator"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-Wise Roadmap","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Physics & Laboratory Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong foundations in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanics"},{"text":"Electricity and magnetism"},{"text":"Optics"},{"text":"Thermal physics"},{"text":"Waves"},{"text":"Modern physics"},{"text":"Basic electronics"},{"text":"Mathematics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Laboratory fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Measurement techniques"},{"text":"Units and dimensions"},{"text":"Significant figures"},{"text":"Experimental errors"},{"text":"Uncertainty"},{"text":"Graph plotting"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Laboratory documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Basic equipment"},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Multimeters"},{"text":"Power supplies"},{"text":"Oscilloscopes"},{"text":"Function generators"},{"text":"Vernier calipers"},{"text":"Micrometers"},{"text":"Weighing instruments"},{"text":"Optical benches"},{"text":"Basic sensors"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Experimental Physics & Instrumentation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Move from performing prescribed experiments to understanding how instruments work."},{"type":"h","text":"Electronics & measurement"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DC/AC circuits"},{"text":"Resistors"},{"text":"Capacitors"},{"text":"Inductors"},{"text":"Diodes"},{"text":"Transistors"},{"text":"Operational amplifiers"},{"text":"Digital electronics"},{"text":"Sensors"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Instrumentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Signal measurement"},{"text":"Voltage/current measurement"},{"text":"Frequency measurement"},{"text":"Temperature measurement"},{"text":"Pressure measurement"},{"text":"Optical measurement"},{"text":"Data acquisition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn calibration concepts"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reference Standard","Instrument Measurement","Comparison","Error Identification","Adjustment / Correction","Calibration Record"]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Laboratory Specialization","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Choose one or two areas to develop deeper expertise."},{"type":"h","text":"Possible specializations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electronics and instrumentation"},{"text":"Optics and photonics"},{"text":"Nuclear/radiation instrumentation"},{"text":"Materials characterization"},{"text":"Semiconductor testing"},{"text":"Computational physics"},{"text":"Vacuum systems"},{"text":"Cryogenic systems"},{"text":"Environmental measurements"},{"text":"Educational laboratory management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"Jupyter"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use them for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Experimental data cleaning"},{"text":"Graphing"},{"text":"Error analysis"},{"text":"Curve fitting"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Automated reporting"}]}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Target Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"Physics Fundamentals"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Laboratory Practice"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Measurement"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Instrumentation"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Experimental Error Analysis"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Calibration Fundamentals"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Electrical Safety"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Equipment Maintenance"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Electronics"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Data Analysis"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Technical Documentation"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Oscilloscope"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Multimeter"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Function Generator"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Data Acquisition"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Laboratory Inventory"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Troubleshooting"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Advanced"}]]}]},{"heading":"Laboratory Equipment Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong candidate should be comfortable with common laboratory instruments."},{"type":"h","text":"Electrical / electronics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital multimeter"},{"text":"Oscilloscope"},{"text":"Function generator"},{"text":"DC power supply"},{"text":"LCR meter"},{"text":"Soldering equipment"},{"text":"Logic analyser"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Optics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Optical bench"},{"text":"Spectrometer"},{"text":"Photodiodes"},{"text":"Lasers"},{"text":"Polarizers"},{"text":"Lenses"},{"text":"Interferometers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"General physics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vernier caliper"},{"text":"Micrometer"},{"text":"Electronic balance"},{"text":"Thermocouple"},{"text":"Temperature sensors"},{"text":"Pressure gauges"},{"text":"The exact equipment depends on the laboratory."}]}]},{"heading":"Major Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Instrument Calibration Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a measuring instrument and study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Measurement range"},{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Resolution"},{"text":"Repeatability"},{"text":"Error"},{"text":"Calibration procedure"},{"text":"Create a professional calibration record."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Oscilloscope-Based Signal Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Function generator"},{"text":"Oscilloscope"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Measure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"Amplitude"},{"text":"Phase"},{"text":"Waveform characteristics"},{"text":"Analyse results using Python or Excel."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Sensor Measurement System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simple measurement system using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sensor"},{"text":"Microcontroller"},{"text":"Data acquisition"},{"text":"Computer"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sensor","Signal Conditioning","Microcontroller / DAQ","Data","Python","Graph + Analysis"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Optical Experiment"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop an experiment involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Light intensity"},{"text":"Wavelength"},{"text":"Reflection"},{"text":"Refraction"},{"text":"Diffraction"},{"text":"Interference"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Experimental setup"},{"text":"Measurement method"},{"text":"Uncertainty"},{"text":"Results"},{"text":"Interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Automated Data Acquisition"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a system that automatically records measurements."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Temperature Sensor","DAQ / Microcontroller","Computer","Python","CSV Database","Graph / Report"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly valuable because modern laboratories increasingly use digital data acquisition."},{"type":"h","text":"